  <name>Shopping List</name>
  <summary>The household's shopping list</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Shopping List keeps what the household needs to buy. Every item has one
      of three priorities and a category, so the list is easy to scan in the
      shop.
    </p>
    <p>
      It works offline. The list stays on your device unless the household
      shares a space over storage it configured itself, on GitHub or on a
      WebDAV server of its choice. There is no server of ours, no account and
      no telemetry.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer id="de.nexumia">
